# ===== OPENSPEC =====
# Change archive is disposable local scratch, intentionally NOT version-controlled.
# Rationale: it is never read for truth; git commit history is the record of shipped
# changes, and durable architectural decisions are promoted to docs/RFC/ (see
# openspec/README.md). Living truth lives in openspec/specs/ (tracked). Local copies
# stay on disk for peeking — delete them anytime; git ignores the folder either way.
openspec/changes/archive/*
!openspec/changes/archive/.gitkeep


examples

feedback
